"""Specific authored residents, including a small set of individually named yokai."""
PEOPLE = []
def person(name, role, place, gender, age, species, look, public, want, flaw, voice, quirk, weapon='', method='', faction='', major=False, ties=''):
    PEOPLE.append(dict(name=name,role=role,place=place,gender=gender,age=age,species=species,look=look,public=public,want=want,flaw=flaw,voice=voice,quirk=quirk,weapon=weapon,method=method,faction=faction,major=major,ties=ties))

person('Shōen Kagetsuna','Shogun of Akitsuhara','Benitsuru Castle','male',71,'Oni',
 'steel-gray hair tied high, deep green eyes, two swept ivory horns, a broad weathered face and a heavy, still-powerful build',
 'A former campaigning commander now spends more time hearing water disputes than drawing a blade. He can be amused by a blunt answer and ruthless about a missed obligation. His residence contains an embarrassingly large collection of cheap carved animals.',
 'Leave a functioning country whose roads and courts survive his death.',
 'He mistakes a refusal to centralize for a refusal to protect ordinary people, and quietly rewards officials who confirm his view.',
 'Low, conversational sentences; a joke can end halfway when he notices an evasion.',
 'Rearranges carved badgers on the edge of a map when thinking.',
 'a broad-backed tachi in a plain scabbard','A grounded two-handed guard, Earth bracing and short Metal reinforcements; he favors an honest opening over pursuit.',
 'Kagetsuna Shogunate',True,'Ayame Kagetsuna is his daughter and field commander. Kureha Tsubakiri wants investment rights he has repeatedly limited; Masazane Saionoma resists his proposed grain levies.')
person('Ayame Kagetsuna','road commander and Shogunal heir','Kagetsuna Household','female',33,'Oni',
 'black hair in a thick ponytail, amber eyes, short red horns and a compact athletic build',
 'Ayame knows the roads by their damaged bridges and the names of innkeepers. She prefers field inspection to audiences, races anyone foolish enough to accept and cannot resist a good street dumpling.',
 'Prove she can command without borrowing her father’s reputation.',
 'She volunteers other people for difficult work before checking whether they can afford the risk.',
 'Brisk and direct, with suddenly elaborate politeness when embarrassed.',
 'Counts bridge planks with the toe of one boot.',
 'a steel naginata','A mobile long guard with Wind-assisted changes of line; she commits hard and must recover her footing.',
 'Kagetsuna Shogunate',True,'Shōen Kagetsuna is her father. Yuzuri Kageura was once her reconnaissance partner; their trust survives a serious disagreement about civilian informants.')
person('Masazane Saionoma','head of House Saionoma','Mizuhara Castle','male',62,'Oni',
 'auburn hair streaked white, hazel eyes, thick outward-curving tan horns and a large comfortable belly',
 'A generous host and formidable negotiator, Masazane can discuss ferries, recipes and inheritance with equal appetite. His dining room is genuinely welcoming; his toll negotiations are not.',
 'Keep western food and ferry routes under local control.',
 'He calls favoritism hospitality and lets relatives accumulate exemptions that his poorer neighbors cannot obtain.',
 'Expansive, humorous and exact about the one word that changes a contract.',
 'Offers a second bowl while arguing over the price of the first.',
 'a short heavy spear','He holds a low, guarded line and uses Water to spoil an approach rather than chase a nimble opponent.',
 'House Saionoma',True,'Rin Saionoma is his adult daughter. Shōen Kagetsuna respects his practical knowledge and resents his selective accounts.')
person('Rin Saionoma','archer and western household envoy','Saionoma Household','female',27,'Oni',
 'long copper hair in two loose braids, blue eyes, small polished cream horns and a tall slender build',
 'Rin runs the household’s archery mornings and speaks at trade meetings. She appears accommodating, then remembers every concession she made and expects it to be returned.',
 'Build an independent career carrying agreements between households.',
 'She overpromises to keep a room friendly and leaves someone else to explain the limits.',
 'Warm and quick; she repeats a question very softly when it has been avoided.',
 'Keeps a notebook of terrible jokes collected on the road.',
 'a long asymmetrical bow','A quiet side-on stance, measured releases and learned Wind corrections; cover still spoils a shot.',
 'House Saionoma',False,'Masazane Saionoma is her father. She regularly trades books with Akane Natsukawa without agreeing with her politics.')
person('Kureha Tsubakiri','head of House Tsubakiri','Koganedai Castle','female',54,'Oni',
 'silver-lilac hair pinned in a low knot, wine-red eyes, black horns tipped pale gold and an imposing narrow build',
 'Kureha supports apprentices, collects badly painted theater masks and invites foreign specialists to her court. She sees new equipment as insurance against a future in which the capital decides every eastern obligation.',
 'Make her house indispensable without submitting its workshops to Shogunal control.',
 'She tolerates coercive contracts when they produce results and insists that charity settles the moral balance.',
 'Unhurried, lucid and unexpectedly funny about ordinary inconveniences.',
 'Turns an ugly mask toward anyone who is flattering her.',
 'a lacquered combat fan with metal ribs','She holds distance with Metal-edged fan turns and layered wards; she withdraws rather than accept a heroic last stand.',
 'House Tsubakiri',True,'Shigure Tsubakiri is her younger brother. She knows he hides some purchases, but does not know the full purpose of the articulated weapon in his private store.')
person('Shigure Tsubakiri','household procurement envoy','Tsubakiri Residence','male',41,'Oni',
 'ink-black hair with one pale streak, ice-blue eyes, slim swept black horns and a long elegant face',
 'A charming collector of curious mechanisms, Shigure sponsors demonstrations and remembers a guest’s favorite drink. He takes an insulting pleasure in explaining why someone cannot afford his help.',
 'Force the court to negotiate with him as an equal by controlling a decisive imported weapon.',
 'He has arranged intimidation and false debt claims to acquire workshop land, and considers fear a reasonable cost of efficiency.',
 'Velvet courtesy, precise names and short questions whose answers he already suspects.',
 'Opens and closes a tiny empty lacquer case while listening.',
 'a slim katana; a concealed articulated magitech polearm prototype is locked at the works','His ordinary sword work is economical and guarded. The heavy prototype unfolds crystal-fed braced limbs around a cutting staff, demanding setup, charge and recovery; it is not a concealed gun or a limitless barrage.',
 'House Tsubakiri',True,'Kureha Tsubakiri is his older sister. Hatsu Kanesue maintains his private mechanism and knows its overheating problem; Naoe Futami holds evidence of his land threats.')
person('Hiyori Mitsuba','capital guild clerk',"Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch",'female',26,'Oni',
 'short coral-pink hair, bright brown eyes, small ivory horns and a petite adult build',
 'Hiyori is quick with names, terrible at hiding curiosity and convinced every adventurer has one good story. Her neatly filed complaints are decorated with tiny invented monsters.',
 'Become the branch’s expedition coordinator while keeping time for amateur puppet theater.',
 'She becomes nosy when someone refuses a harmless question and occasionally recommends work because she wants to hear what happens.',
 'Cheerful, practical and slightly too fast; official language appears only when someone tries to bully her.',
 'Gives a paper monster a different voice for each troublesome account.',
 'a short practice staff kept beneath the counter','She uses simple wards and a practiced staff guard to protect a doorway while calling trained help.',
 "Adventurer's Guild",True,'Tadayoshi Kurebayashi supervises the branch. She regularly exchanges public contract notices with Komugi Hanabishi in Glowhaven.')
person('Sae Kagurazaka','keeper of Evening Maple Shrine','Evening Maple Shrine','female',39,'Oni',
 'plum-colored shoulder-length hair, pale gold eyes, two short white horns and strong work-worn hands',
 'Sae repairs bells, teaches practical shrine forms and laughs loudly at her own poor cooking. She welcomes doubtful visitors and has very little patience for a noble who expects a private blessing during a public queue.',
 'Keep the shrine useful to living neighbors as well as its remembered dead.',
 'She delays painful conversations with jokes until a small resentment becomes a real dispute.',
 'Warm, plain and teasing, with a clear change to careful words around grief.',
 'Taps a repaired bell against her wrist before trusting its tone.',
 'a cedar staff with a small bronze bell','Her Soul wards settle disturbances at a defined boundary; she can interrupt a possessing spirit but cannot command all dead beings.',
 'Maple Lantern Custodians',True,'Iori Kagurazaka is her adult nephew and apprentice. Oroha once carried a lost shrine message across the mist; Sae knows only what that encounter actually revealed.')
person('Tōma Sagiri','wandering rōnin and occasional escort','Red Maple Inn','male',36,'Human',
 'untidy dark-blue hair, gray-green eyes, a lean weathered face and a crooked old nose',
 'Tōma earns lodging through escort work, loses at board games and refuses to explain a duel that everyone else explains for him. He is easy company until someone tries to turn a public insult into a compulsory fight.',
 'Choose obligations he can honor instead of serving another household blindly.',
 'He drinks away money meant for tomorrow’s room and disappears rather than admit a promise has become too much.',
 'Dry, relaxed and attentive; anger makes him simpler rather than louder.',
 'Repairs cheap straw sandals with absurd precision.',
 'a worn uchigatana','A loose high guard becomes one precise cutting line; learned Arcane reinforcement steadies the blade but gives no second automatic attack.',
 'Akitsuhara',True,'Chiyo Matsukaze sells him replacement sandals and refuses him credit. He once served under Jirō Hozumi and will not join his former unit again.')
person('Yuzuri Kageura','leader of the Reed Veil Fellowship','Hidden Reed Training Ground','female',34,'Oni',
 'dark teal hair in a high braided knot, violet eyes, narrow gray horns and a wiry athletic build',
 'Yuzuri trains scouts who can observe, carry a message and return alive. Outside work she grows ridiculous ornamental gourds and is fiercely competitive about their shapes.',
 'Keep her fellowship independent enough to refuse an order that spends civilian lives.',
 'She withholds useful information to test people and can mistake exhausted confusion for dishonesty.',
 'Quiet, exact and fond of answering a bad question with a more uncomfortable one.',
 'Polishes a gourd while conducting a serious conversation.',
 'a kusarigama with a short working chain','An offset stance uses the weighted chain to obstruct an approach, then closes with the sickle. Illusions alter limited sightlines; they do not make her undetectable.',
 'Reed Veil Fellowship',True,'Ayame Kagetsuna was her field partner. Sōta Amemiya is her capable but aggravating apprentice, whose enthusiasm she routinely mistakes for showing off.')
person('Genzaburō Kanemori','weaponsmith','Benitsuru Craft Quarter','male',67,'Oni',
 'white hair cut close, orange-brown eyes, blunt charcoal horns and a heavily muscled torso',
 'A celebrated smith with a beautiful singing voice, Genzaburō makes practical weapons and complains that people judge steel by its reflection. He repairs a farmer’s tool with as much care as a lord’s blade, provided he has agreed the price.',
 'Pass on the workshop without letting its standards become a family entitlement.',
 'His pride makes apologies nearly impossible and he punishes a careless apprentice with humiliating sarcasm.',
 'Gruff detail punctuated by unexpectedly lyrical comparisons to music.',
 'Hums one note while testing the fit of a guard.',
 'a short forging hammer','A rooted stance, controlled hammer blows and learned Metal adjustments; he does not turn an entire armory into a flying storm.',
 'Akitsuhara',True,'Maho Kanemori is his adult daughter and business manager. Hatsu Kanesue trained with him before accepting imported-device work; they still argue about what counts as good craft.')
person('Kinu Amakusa','performer and theater proprietor','Eight Petals Theater','female',31,'Oni',
 'long turquoise hair, rose-brown eyes, small rose-colored horns and a tall graceful build',
 'Kinu can command an audience and forget her own lunch. She stages ridiculous comedies, loves gaudy cloth and brags about reviews she has very carefully memorized.',
 'Make a traveling production that audiences outside the capital actually understand.',
 'She turns private arguments into material and is offended when the person involved fails to find it funny.',
 'Musical and expansive, suddenly flat when someone negotiates the fee.',
 'Practices an audience bow in every polished window.',
 'a pair of reinforced dance fans','Flowing Fire ribbons follow her fan turns in controlled performances; in danger she screens a retreat instead of setting a packed audience alight.',
 'Akitsuhara',True,'Renjirō Usami builds her sets and can veto an unsafe stunt. Her quarrels with Fūka Suzumori usually end over food, then resume the next rehearsal.')
person('Renga Itsuzaki','leader of the Broken Kite band','Broken Kite Camp','female',32,'Human',
 'cropped rust-red hair, dark brown eyes, a split eyebrow and broad shoulders',
 'Renga presents herself as a collector of road dues and is offended when people call that robbery. She is funny, hospitable to her own crew and very willing to hurt someone who cannot pay.',
 'Own a legitimate roadside business without surrendering the money taken to fund it.',
 'She treats a victim’s fear as bargaining weakness and can turn a failed bluff into needless violence.',
 'Companionable jokes followed by blunt prices and impatient threats.',
 'Collects attractive stolen spoons, then claims they were all gifts.',
 'a long hooked spear','A low reaching guard controls the narrow camp entrance; Earth workings throw up short obstructions for an escape.',
 'Broken Kite Band',True,'Katsuho Enoki is her quartermaster and oldest friend. Jun Sasanami has begun resenting the risks she calls a shared burden.')

# Supporting residents have individual wants and faults, not automatic quest-giver identities.
person('Tadayoshi Kurebayashi','guild branch master',"Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch",'male',52,'Human','salt-and-pepper hair, brown eyes and a thick neatly trimmed beard','He likes field journals, slow tea and an office door that remains open. A quiet reputation for competence attracts requests he would rather decline.','Keep the branch solvent without making it a household’s private labor office.','He postpones difficult refusals and lets the clerk absorb the anger.','Measured and amiable; he takes a long breath before bad news.','Resquares the same stack of letters.','a plain arming sword','A guarded line and a simple shield ward.',"Adventurer's Guild",ties='Hiyori Mitsuba is his clerk; he relies on her more than he admits.')
person('Mika Fuyuse','guild examiner',"Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch",'female',38,'Oni','straight silver hair, dark blue eyes and two stout blue-gray horns','An examiner who enjoys fishing and awful melodramas, Mika asks applicants to explain a retreat as readily as an attack.','Train another examiner so she can take a real holiday.','She becomes impatient with nervous people who need time to answer.','Short, practical questions with a surprising snort of laughter.','Balances a practice staff on two fingers.','a padded spear','Measured reach, controlled stops and simple Water diversions.',"Adventurer's Guild")
person('Nobu Senda','transit registrar','Benitsuru Portal Shrine','male',45,'Oni','neat brown hair, pale green eyes and slim ivory horns','Nobu loves train-like timetables in a country that has no trains, keeps ferry schedules for pleasure and remembers every lost umbrella.','Make the transit desk reliable enough to leave it to a deputy.','He confuses neat forms with truthful accounts.','Courteous, precise and occasionally pedantic.','Checks his pocket watch before giving an estimate.','','Defensive Arcane screens protect a waiting lane.','Akitsuhara')
person('Akane Natsukawa','capital magistrate','Benitsuru Magistracy','female',49,'Human','black hair in a severe bun, amber eyes and a tall angular frame','A patient magistrate who loves lurid novels, Akane insists that a powerful signature is still only one piece of evidence.','Keep hearings accessible to people who cannot hire a household advocate.','She can value a clever argument more than a frightened witness’s poor explanation.','Clear, dry and unhurried.','Marks her novel with an unused legal ribbon.','','A practiced ward buys time for the watch.','Akitsuhara',ties='Rin Saionoma is a regular book-trading acquaintance, not a private route to favorable rulings.')
person('Kensuke Ayahara','public petition advocate','Benitsuru Magistracy','male',29,'Oni','wavy lavender hair, gray eyes and small brown horns','Kensuke translates grievances into usable petitions and performs amateur comedy with much less success.','Win enough trust to open an independent practice.','He promises a clever solution before checking the boring facts.','Quick, enthusiastic and prone to correcting himself.','Flips a closed fan when searching for a phrase.','','Illusion examples illustrate testimony without constituting evidence.','Akitsuhara')
person('Naoe Futami','residential carpenter','Canal Ward Homes','female',43,'Oni','dark brown braid, green eyes and worn pale horns','Naoe rebuilds doors, raises a niece and dislikes polite people who never name their price.','Keep her workshop and home through a disputed land purchase.','She rejects help if it sounds like charity and can insult someone who meant well.','Blunt and funny, with a warm laugh for practical absurdity.','Tests a chair before trusting a host.','a woodworking adze','Strong close leverage and a brief Earth brace.','Akitsuhara',ties='Shigure Tsubakiri’s agents have pressured her to sell. She has retained their actual letters.')
person('Chiyo Matsukaze','innkeeper','Red Maple Inn','female',42,'Oni','long dark chestnut hair, amber eyes and two smooth ivory horns','A welcoming host who notices muddy boots, Chiyo enjoys dice games and bright woven coats.','Buy the neighboring courtyard for a proper kitchen garden.','She retells a private embarrassment when a crowded table rewards the story.','Warm, knowing and suddenly crisp about a bill.','Folds a fan while watching a troublesome guest.','','Wind lifts dust and guides a light tray; she seeks the watch rather than duel guests.','Akitsuhara',ties='Tōma Sagiri owes her for two broken cups, not free lifetime lodging.')
person('Tetsu Obana','clinic physician','Benitsuru Ward Clinic','male',58,'Human','gray hair worn in a loose queue, dark eyes and a heavy stoop','A physician who breeds ornamental beetles, Tetsu can sound indifferent while spending an hour on a difficult dressing.','Train a practitioner willing to stay in the working ward.','He is dismissive about pain he cannot measure and needs reminding to listen.','Slow, specific and almost never grand.','Cleans his spectacles with the wrong sleeve.','','Healing stabilizes treatable injury; difficult cases still take time and supplies.','Akitsuhara')
person('Fūka Suzumori','dancer and costume maker','Eight Petals Theater','female',28,'Beastfolk','fox ears above burgundy hair, gold eyes, a human face and a single russet tail','Fūka dances beautifully and keeps disastrous accounts. She enjoys loud jewelry and refuses to make every heroine wear pale pink.','Design costumes for a full traveling troupe.','She spends advances before measuring the cloth.','Bright, cutting and affectionate with people who can take a joke.','Counts fabric lengths against her own arm.','','Graceful Finesse work and small Illusion accents.','Akitsuhara',ties='Kinu Amakusa commissions her costumes; their friendship survives genuinely nasty rehearsal arguments.')
person('Renjirō Usami','stage carpenter','Eight Petals Theater','male',37,'Oni','shaved scalp, dark green eyes and blunt copper horns','Renjirō builds scenery, cooks excellent noodles and loves a terrible pun.','Keep the theater safe without becoming its permanent spoilsport.','He can turn a justified safety objection into a personal lecture.','Mild until interrupted, then magnificently detailed.','Measures doorways with an outstretched hand.','a heavy tool mallet','Braced physical defense and controlled Metal reinforcement.','Akitsuhara')
person('Maho Kanemori','workshop manager','Benitsuru Craft Quarter','female',35,'Oni','black hair with copper-dyed ends, brown eyes and short charcoal horns','Maho handles commissions, prizes loud festival music and has a collection of expensive gloves she is afraid to use.','Keep the family workshop’s quality without living entirely by her father’s standards.','She hides small production mistakes until fixing them becomes expensive.','Fast, practical and very courteous when annoyed.','Tugs each glove finger twice.','','Enchantment work assists actual tools and learned control.','Akitsuhara',ties='Genzaburō Kanemori is her father. Hatsu Kanesue remains a friend despite their workshops’ rivalry.')
person('Hatsu Kanesue','magitech mechanism specialist','Ginkgo Crossbow Works','female',40,'Human','short iron-gray hair, violet eyes and a sturdy scarred build','Hatsu likes puzzles, dislikes sales demonstrations and repairs the devices everyone else calls miraculous.','Earn enough to leave military commissions and make assistive tools.','She accepts secrecy clauses she knows will protect abusive clients.','Dry technical language with occasional spectacular swearing.','Keeps a broken screw in her pocket as a reminder.','a compact magitech crossbow','A braced firing stance; actual loaded bolts and a finite crystal charge constrain repeat shots.','House Tsubakiri',ties='Shigure Tsubakiri controls her largest contract. Genzaburō Kanemori taught her metal fitting; Maho Kanemori still visits for tea.')
person('Jirō Hozumi','captain of the capital watch','Benitsuru Castle','male',47,'Oni','short black hair, gray eyes and scarred red horns','Jirō raises orchids and prefers a resolved complaint to an impressive arrest.','Keep his patrols trusted through the disputes between households.','He protects a favored subordinate too long after a credible complaint.','Level and economical, with a soft voice for frightened witnesses.','Smooths a damaged orchid leaf.','a jitte and side sword','A closed guarded stance, weapon catches and short Arcane wards.','Kagetsuna Shogunate',ties='Tōma Sagiri once served in his unit and still knows how to irritate him.')
person('Sōta Amemiya','shinobi apprentice','Hidden Reed Training Ground','male',23,'Human','messy pale blue hair, brown eyes and a narrow athletic build','Sōta is an excellent climber, an enthusiastic gossip and a dreadful secret-keeper about his own achievements.','Lead a real reconnaissance commission.','He embellishes modest success and gets defensive when checked.','Quick, irreverent and far too loud when excited.','Ties practice knots while talking.','a short spear and climbing cord','Finesse movement, observation and small Wind-assisted balance corrections.','Reed Veil Fellowship',ties='Yuzuri Kageura is his teacher.')
person('Iori Kagurazaka','shrine apprentice','Evening Maple Shrine','male',22,'Oni','soft brown hair, lilac eyes and small white horns','Iori remembers offerings and forgets meals, wants to be mysterious and blushes whenever anyone calls him kind.','Perform a boundary tending without his aunt checking every step.','He pretends he has understood an instruction rather than ask again.','Careful and formal until an ordinary joke breaks his composure.','Turns a little bronze clapper over in his palm.','a short cedar staff','Patient Soul forms protect a narrow place; he retreats when a working exceeds his training.','Maple Lantern Custodians',ties='Sae Kagurazaka is his aunt and teacher.')
person('Chinatsu Hanegi','sword instructor','Morning Crane Dojo','female',44,'Oni','silver-white ponytail, blue eyes and long ivory horns','Chinatsu likes gardening, sweet rice and students who can admit they missed.','Prepare an assistant who can teach without imitating her voice.','She confuses relentless correction with useful attention.','Flat and exact; rare praise is embarrassingly direct.','Straightens the loan swords after every class.','a practice bokken and steel katana','A disciplined high-to-middle guard with precise Finesse counters.','Morning Crane School')
person('Yūhei Toba','public school teacher','Benitsuru Public School','male',32,'Human','curly brown hair, green eyes and ink-stained spectacles','Yūhei teaches numbers and letters, loves bird calls and laughs much too readily at a classroom prank.','Keep evening lessons available to working adults.','He avoids confronting a disruptive wealthy patron.','Patient explanations, then quick embarrassed digressions.','Draws a bird beside a particularly good answer.','','Simple Arcane demonstrations and an ordinary defensive ward.','Akitsuhara')
person('Natsuko Tsumura','canal food seller','Lantern Canal Market','female',51,'Oni','dark red bun, brown eyes and broad pale horns','Natsuko feeds workers, judges strangers by their appetite and bets on boat races.','Send her adult son traveling before the stall becomes his whole world.','She calls intrusive questions concern and ignores polite attempts to end them.','Loud, warm and completely unembarrassed.','Slaps a dough ball onto the board for emphasis.','','Controlled Fire heats a cooking surface.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kōichi Aratani','caravan organizer','South Gate Caravan Yard','male',46,'Oni','brown hair in a short braid, amber eyes and chipped gray horns','Kōichi organizes loads, collects maps and is sentimental about old pack animals.','Keep independent carriers from being bought out.','He gives optimistic departure estimates to avoid losing a customer.','Easy banter with sharp logistical questions.','Weighs an empty strap in his hands.','a sturdy spear','Guarded escort work and Earth anchors hold a narrow approach.','Akitsuhara')

person('Yae Mizuno','posthouse keeper','Blackpine Posthouse','female',48,'Oni','black hair with silver temples, green eyes and short tan horns','Yae enjoys weather reports and crude woodcarving, and can produce hot soup while apparently asleep.','Repair the guest loft before the next wet season.','She overcharges travelers who sound condescending.','Drowsy humor with a sudden sharp edge.','Carves tiny spoons during quiet hours.','','Fire tending and a loud alarm bell.','Akitsuhara')
person('Haru Tomisaka','courier','Blackpine Posthouse','male',24,'Human','sandy hair, hazel eyes and long restless legs','Haru runs letters, loves love songs and lies about how often he gets lost.','Save for a good riding animal.','He takes shortcuts after giving sound advice against them.','Breathless and cheerful.','Checks the wrong pocket first.','a light short spear','Quick footwork and short Wind bursts aid escape.','Akitsuhara')
person('Sachi Morisawa','village baker','Cedarfall Hamlet','female',36,'Oni','dark green hair, brown eyes and little cream horns','Sachi bakes communal bread, writes rude poems and dislikes being called motherly.','Open a roadside counter of her own.','She hears criticism where someone only requested a different filling.','Plain and sarcastic.','Dusts flour from her elbow.','','Controlled Fire and practical first aid.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kazuma Ebisawa','forester','Western Woodcutters\' Yard','male',55,'Oni','gray-brown hair, gold eyes and thick dark horns','Kazuma knows the timber stands, grows roses and cannot whistle despite trying every morning.','Secure a fair cutting boundary.','He mistakes tradition for proof of ownership.','Slow and confident until asked for dates.','Attempts a whistle when considering a lie.','a working axe','Powerful close strokes and cautious Earth bracing.','Akitsuhara')
person('Mina Kurusu','charcoal cutter','Bamboo Charcoal Camp','female',29,'Human','short orange-brown hair, gray eyes and broad callused hands','Mina runs a small crew, tells excellent ghost stories and refuses to sleep nearest the door.','Pay her workers before accepting another commission.','She gambles to solve shortfalls and conceals the losses.','Rough humor and quick practical instructions.','Checks a coal twice before calling it dead.','a heavy chopping knife','Short guarded cuts, cover and a planned retreat.','Akitsuhara')
person('Osamu Kariya','quarry foreman','Thundercrag Quarry','male',59,'Oni','bald scalp, dark eyes and blunt black horns','Osamu collects decorative cups and writes affectionate letters to a partner who hates sentimental prose.','Keep the working faces safe while meeting the stone order.','He hides a near-miss to avoid a shutdown.','Loud over machinery, quiet about personal matters.','Checks a knot with both thumbs.','a short stone hammer','Earth steadies supports but does not replace them.','Akitsuhara')
person('Tae Ishihama','miner and washhouse organizer','Kuroishi Miners\' Row','female',42,'Oni','thick dark braid, blue eyes and outward-curving ocher horns','Tae swims, sings badly and keeps the row’s shared washhouse running.','Obtain compensation for an injured neighbor.','She turns a minor slight into a collective grievance.','Blunt, spirited and full of names.','Rubs soap into a rag while arguing.','','Water channels and strong practical hauling.','Akitsuhara')
person('Shunji Dobashi','kiln master','Basalt Kilns','male',38,'Human','wavy black hair, brown eyes and a broad sun-dark face','Shunji loves fine ceramics and cheap sweets, and hates watching anyone eat over his glaze samples.','Find a reliable new clay source.','He blames an apprentice before checking his own firing notes.','Patient technical detail and abrupt irritation.','Taps his teeth with a clean fingernail.','','Measured Fire and Earth work.','Akitsuhara')
person('Ruri Nabatame','mine surveyor','Amber-Salt Mine','female',27,'Oni','teal hair pinned short, gray eyes and small slate horns','Ruri enjoys numbers, sour plums and making confident porters admit they cannot read her maps.','Publish an accurate local survey.','She withholds a simple explanation to make someone feel foolish.','Dry, clever and pleased with precision.','Turns the map instead of her head.','a metal-tipped surveying staff','Arcane tracing and Metal tests support actual sampling.','Akitsuhara')
person('Hokuto Mizusawa','mountain porter','Quarry Exchange','male',31,'Beastfolk','dark hair, brown eyes, wolf ears and a mostly human broad face','Hokuto carries loads, knits tiny animals and becomes offended when strength is treated as his only skill.','Buy a share in a carrier team.','He accepts loads beyond the agreed limit to prove a point.','Gruff, literal and unexpectedly gentle about craft.','Tests a strap against one shoulder.','a short iron-shod staff','Force guard, hauling discipline and short Earth braces.','Akitsuhara')
person('Shizue Amakawa','pilgrim lodge keeper','Shiun Pilgrim Lodge','female',64,'Human','white hair in two thin braids, dark eyes and a strong square face','Shizue knows the mountain weather, adores gossip and assigns beds with ruthless fairness.','Train a keeper who will not turn the lodge into a luxury retreat.','She assumes she knows why a guest is upset.','Warm commands and pointed little questions.','Moves wet sandals without touching their straps.','','Wind dries a small space; she closes an unsafe route rather than promise protection.','Akitsuhara')
person('Dōgen Hanamori','monastery teacher','Cloudbell Monastery','male',63,'Oni','cropped white hair, gray eyes and long weathered brown horns','Dōgen teaches breathing forms, plays an excellent drum and laughs at pompous spiritual claims.','Reconcile two feuding teachers before losing their students.','He can dismiss genuine fear as attachment to comfort.','Mild questions followed by very direct practical examples.','Taps a rhythm against his sleeve.','a long cedar staff','A stable staff guard and learned Sound pulses disturb timing.','Maple Lantern Custodians')
person('Fusa Minase','herbal grower','Shiun Herb Slopes','female',74,'Fae','white hair under a colorful scarf, amber eyes, short gray antlers, translucent leaf-moth wings and a four-foot-six adult body','Fusa tends roots, hoards pretty bottles and refuses to explain why she has twelve identical hoes.','Keep the cultivated beds from being mistaken for public gathering ground.','She sabotages a rival’s cheap sale with a rumor.','Cackling wit and very firm prices.','Smells a leaf before recognizing its visitor.','','Nature encourages actual plants; medicine remains real preparation.','Akitsuhara')
person('Naohiro Umemoto','archive keeper','Ancestor Archive','male',46,'Human','black hair with gray streaks, pale brown eyes and round spectacles','Naohiro loves detective tales and is disappointed when the obvious explanation is correct.','Recover a damaged boundary register.','He lends credibility to an exciting theory too soon.','Careful, eager and full of qualifications.','Stacks two bookmarks in every book.','','Divination yields limited impressions that must be checked against evidence.','Akitsuhara')
person('Sana Kuroiwa','refuge keeper','Snowcedar Refuge','female',39,'Oni','dark red hair cropped close, hazel eyes and ivory horns','Sana likes loud songs, immaculate boots and talking to quiet people who would rather be left alone.','Keep a reliable refuge beyond house politics.','She refuses to admit she needs more help.','Booming hospitality and brisk orders.','Kicks snow from everyone’s boots herself.','a heavy walking spear','Earth anchoring and patient defensive reach.','Akitsuhara')
person('Rei Tsunemori','signal keeper','Snowcedar Signal Hut','male',28,'Human','white-blond hair, blue eyes and long ink-stained fingers','Rei paints landscapes and envies people whose work sounds exciting.','Get his paintings shown in the capital.','He dramatizes weather reports to make his post seem important.','Earnest and slightly theatrical.','Draws cloud shapes on scrap wrappers.','','Light signals and careful weather observation.','Akitsuhara')
person('Yoriko Abe','mountain guide','Snowcedar Refuge','female',44,'Oni','black bob, silver-gray eyes and short charcoal horns','Yoriko loves warm baths, collects dice and refuses to guide someone who treats a porter as furniture.','Save for a small lakeside home.','She takes a dislike quickly and charges for it.','Plain, amused and economical.','Rolls one die inside a glove.','a hooked climbing spear','Guarded reach, practical rope work and small Ice anchors.','Akitsuhara')

person('Tomoe Masuda','ferry captain','Mizuhara Landing','female',40,'Human','dark brown hair in a knot, amber eyes and muscular forearms','Tomoe races boats, grows terrible tomatoes and feeds visitors anyway.','Replace the ferry’s aging hull.','She skips a small repair when a competitor is watching.','Warm competitive banter.','Runs a thumb along a repaired seam.','a hooked walking staff','Finesse leverage and Water adjustments help real boat handling.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kayo Yagiri','inn host','Three Reeds Inn','female',45,'Oni','blue-black shoulder hair, gold eyes and curved brown horns','Kayo loves embroidery, terrifying stories and guests who pay before becoming familiar.','Make the inn known for its cooking.','She treats criticism of the broth as a personal betrayal.','Sly, warm and precise about terms.','Turns an embroidered cuff outward for praise.','','Fire heats the cookstove; she uses a staff to hold a doorway in danger.','Akitsuhara')
person('Yasuo Natori','boatwright','Reedwake Boatworks','male',57,'Oni','shaggy gray hair, green eyes and thick tan horns','Yasuo builds careful boats, collects unreliable clocks and finds hurrying customers funny.','Finish an accessible ferry ramp.','He refuses to discuss delays until the due date has already passed.','Slow jokes with excellent practical explanations.','Sets a clock that will soon stop again.','','Metal fittings and actual joinery carry his craft.','Akitsuhara')
person('Chika Nishihara','spear teacher','Western Spear Hall','female',33,'Oni','pink-brown braid, dark eyes and small white horns','Chika is disciplined in a lesson and hopelessly competitive at beanbag games.','Build a school affordable to working escorts.','She favors promising pupils and leaves a struggling learner behind.','Crisp, direct and reluctant to praise.','Measures reach with a hanging cord.','a long plain yari','A guarded middle line, lateral steps and precise thrusts.','Akitsuhara')
person('Shin Watarai','bridge food-stall owner','Bamboo Crossing','male',27,'Oni','black hair tied with a yellow cord, brown eyes and red-tipped horns','Shin loves races, invents sauces and becomes shy around anyone who praises his food sincerely.','Open a proper roadside kitchen.','He spends the repair fund on an exciting new recipe.','Fast sales patter, then embarrassed pauses.','Tastes a sauce with the smallest possible spoon.','','Controlled Fire and practical food handling.','Akitsuhara')
person('Mitsue Harada','paper maker','Green Thread Paperworks','female',53,'Oni','gray hair pinned flat, pale green eyes and smooth brown horns','Mitsue makes wonderful paper and ugly garden sculptures she insists are improving.','Fill a large order without exploiting her apprentices.','She hides a mistake rather than risk her reputation.','Dry courtesy and specific questions.','Rubs a sheet between two fingers.','','Water and patient craft prepare actual fibers.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kentarō Maeba','miller','Rainsong Mill','male',37,'Human','brown hair under a cloth cap, hazel eyes and broad shoulders','Kentarō likes riddles, keeps a patient old dog and distrusts overly elegant explanations.','Replace a damaged wheel bearing.','He blames village pranks for ordinary wear.','Friendly and literal.','Listens to a bearing with his cheek near the casing.','','Earth steadies a load while he works.','Akitsuhara')
person('Suzuha Hoshikawa','bathhouse proprietor','Riverglass Baths','female',35,'Fae','long lavender hair, dark brown eyes, small branching antlers and wooden scales along the arms of a short adult body','Suzuha is serene with guests and furious over misplaced towels. She keeps an ambitious succulent collection.','Expand the baths without borrowing from a household.','She dismisses staff suggestions until a guest repeats them.','Gentle, formal and suddenly clipped.','Folds a towel into an exact square.','','Water temperatures are maintained through actual heated channels and practiced control.','Akitsuhara')
person('Daichi Kurobane','shinobi field instructor','Hidden Reed Training Ground','male',42,'Oni','shaved scalp, yellow-brown eyes and slender black horns','Daichi bakes delicate sweets and refuses to make an ominous entrance even when pupils beg.','Teach scouts to notice the person cleaning the room.','He embarrasses a boasting student for an audience.','Matter-of-fact and quietly mischievous.','Offers a sweet immediately after a brutal correction.','a short spear','Close observation, Finesse movement and short Illusion decoys.','Reed Veil Fellowship')
person('Mayu Enomoto','eastern guesthouse keeper','Koganedai Guesthouse','female',46,'Human','black braid, gray-green eyes and a soft rounded face','Mayu raises songbirds, enjoys gossip and remembers which merchants arrived angry last year.','Buy a second kitchen stove.','She gives a wealthy guest more privacy than a poorer one.','Comfortable and probing.','Repeats a guest’s last word while pouring tea.','','Small Arcane assistance moves a light household object.','Akitsuhara')
person('Takuro Namiki','waterworks keeper','Terrace Waterworks','male',50,'Oni','brown hair streaked white, blue eyes and broad ocher horns','Takuro loves river fish and hates being interrupted halfway through a repair explanation.','Get a fair maintenance budget.','He lets a gate fail dramatically after warnings are ignored.','Detailed and irritable.','Taps a wheel spoke for its sound.','','Water redirects actual flow within the channels.','Akitsuhara')
person('Eri Tamura','archery instructor','East Wind Archery Hall','female',36,'Oni','short sky-blue hair, brown eyes and small silver horns','Eri is calm, loves sour candy and cries at very ordinary romances.','Teach a sponsored pupil to enjoy practice again.','She becomes evasive when her own aim is questioned.','Low, precise and unexpectedly tender.','Presses a sweet against one cheek.','a long bow','A stable side-on stance and learned Wind compensation.','Akitsuhara')
person('Seitarō Matsuoka','eastern watch officer','Koganedai Muster Ground','male',39,'Oni','black hair tied short, amber eyes and heavy tan horns','Seitarō plays board games brilliantly and speaks as if every visitor has come for directions.','Keep equipment trials from replacing basic drills.','He is contemptuous of enthusiastic newcomers.','Flat, practical and dryly funny.','Moves an imaginary game piece on a rail.','a spear and small shield','Force guard and simple Metal reinforcement.','House Tsubakiri')
person('Nene Moriyama','public reading-room keeper','Ginkgo Schoolhouse','female',24,'Human','auburn bob, green eyes and round glasses','Nene studies insects, likes fashionable sleeves and refuses to be treated as a timid librarian.','Build a useful traveling book chest.','She corrects an embarrassing error in public when private help would do.','Bright, firm and a little too pleased by a fact.','Checks a sleeve for hitchhiking insects.','','Nature tends the little school garden.','Akitsuhara')
person('Isao Tsuge','lacquer artisan','Goldleaf Arcade','male',61,'Oni','white hair in a short tuft, dark brown eyes and worn black horns','Isao loves delicate lacquer, terrible hats and theatrical insults.','Find a buyer who values repairs as much as new work.','He refuses a sensible compromise to punish bad taste.','Flowery abuse delivered with a welcoming smile.','Turns a bowl in the window light.','','Light reveals finish flaws; the lacquer still needs real preparation.','Akitsuhara')

person('Yumi Sawatari','bridge keeper and trail guide','Mirror-Reed Bridge','female',30,'Oni','dark teal braid, silver eyes and small curved gray horns','Yumi loves jokes, hates gamblers and is secretly a very good one.','Open her own little outfitter’s lodge beside the woodland road.','She places a private bet against a traveler’s boasting.','Quick, teasing and practical.','Reties a trail rope while listening to an implausible story.','a hooked walking staff','Water redirects a little surface flow away from the footing; her hooked staff and a prepared return path provide practical defense.','Akitsuhara')
person('Gorō Fushimi','woodland hamlet headman','Reedglass Woodland Hamlet','male',65,'Human','thin white hair, hazel eyes and a broad weathered face','Gorō hosts vigorous card games and knows the ridge weather better than his children’s moods.','Keep the communal woodland path free of private tolls.','He dismisses a younger person’s good warning.','Slow and opinionated.','Cracks a walnut with the wrong tool.','','Prepared trail markers, practical rope work and a sturdy ward.','Akitsuhara')
person('Aya Takino','bark-dye artisan','Woodland Dye Workshop','female',28,'Oni','pink hair in a loose knot, brown eyes and two short black horns','Aya loves bold stripes, terrible perfumes and a bargain that takes an hour.','Sell directly in the capital.','She overstates a rival’s defects to protect an uncertain shipment.','Bright, sly and very exact about color.','Holds a dye-stained finger beside a customer’s sleeve.','','Water rinses real cloth steeped in dyes made from bark, roots and gathered leaves.','Akitsuhara')
person('Mutsumi Hosaka','farmer and village organizer','Hoshina Village','female',48,'Oni','dark brown hair in a wide bun, green eyes and cream horns','Mutsumi loves dances, practical tools and a well-timed insult.','Keep the irrigation agreement fair through a dry week.','She treats a personal enemy’s complaint as automatically dishonest.','Direct and sociable.','Slaps dust from a stool before offering it.','','Nature tending supports actual crops.','Akitsuhara')
person('Tōru Fukada','granary keeper','Golden Sheaf Granary','male',54,'Human','gray-brown hair, blue eyes and a thick mustache','Tōru loves neat stores, loud festivals and being asked for a practical recommendation.','Replace rotten floorboards before stores arrive.','He hides shortages to avoid public embarrassment.','Genial until numbers disagree.','Balances a tally stick on one finger.','','Earth supports a stack during genuine repairs.','Akitsuhara')
person('Rika Ogata','bridge carpenter','South River Bridge','female',32,'Oni','short orange hair, amber eyes and blunt brown horns','Rika is cheerful, ambitious and convinced every road would benefit from one more bridge.','Lead her own public works crew.','She gives impossible schedules to impress an official.','Rapid, enthusiastic explanations.','Sketches a joint with her heel.','a tool hammer','Braced Force work and Metal fitting.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kenji Morita','orchard keeper','Goldfinch Orchard','male',33,'Oni','green-black curls, brown eyes and little ivory horns','Kenji loves bees, romantic poems and extravagant preserves.','Win a fair price without selling the orchard.','He lets a dispute spoil fruit he could have sold cheaply.','Soft, stubborn and unexpectedly sentimental.','Smells a sealed jar before opening it.','','Nature tending and basic protective wards.','Akitsuhara')
person('Yōko Sanada','rice grower','Low Meadow Paddies','female',43,'Human','black ponytail, dark brown eyes and broad sun-browned shoulders','Yōko races her neighbors home, grows flowers for pleasure and laughs at solemn visitors.','Repair a shared sluice before the next planting.','She takes water first when she thinks others have cheated.','Plain, brisk and playful.','Tests mud with the same sandal toe.','','Water control follows the existing channel rather than creating free irrigation.','Akitsuhara')
person('Kae Sumida','hostel cook','Saffron Road Hostel','female',27,'Oni','silver-blue bob, gold eyes and dark red horns','Kae loves travelers, hot peppers and stories with an embarrassing ending.','Make the hostel a favorite stop.','She promises privacy and then forgets which story was confidential.','Lively and shamelessly curious.','Stirs a cold pot while listening.','','Fire cooks and a simple ward holds a door.','Akitsuhara')
person('Chihiro Noda','shrine guesthouse host','Redleaf Guest Village','male',38,'Oni','brown hair to his shoulders, gray-green eyes and slim ivory horns','Chihiro grows chrysanthemums, writes letters for neighbors and can be astonishingly lazy about his own room.','Repair the guesthouse without a patron’s conditions.','He borrows small sums he forgets were not gifts.','Easygoing, thoughtful and evasive about dates.','Moves a flower vase instead of cleaning beneath it.','','Nature tending and sensible retreat.','Akitsuhara')
person('Makiya Utsugi','beekeeper','Redleaf Apiculture','female',34,'Fae','golden-brown braid, green eyes, dark moth wings and a four-foot-ten adult frame with pointy ears','Makiya is patient with bees and impatient with everyone describing her work as cute.','Keep a disputed orchard free of careless pesticide workings.','She breaks an agreement when she thinks her cause is obviously right.','Flat, exact and unexpectedly witty.','Gently brushes an imaginary bee from her sleeve.','','Nature calms a bounded swarm, not all nearby wildlife.','Akitsuhara')
person('Hajime Niwa','lantern boatman','River Lantern Mooring','male',57,'Human','gray cropped hair, hazel eyes and a wiry broad-backed frame','Hajime enjoys festivals, hates dancing and keeps accepting invitations anyway.','Refit a boat for the next river procession.','He loses his temper at a nervous assistant.','Gruff, friendly and full of practical warnings.','Checks a lantern knot three times.','a boat pole','Guarded leverage and Water work.','Akitsuhara')
person('Asa Kogure','forest shelter keeper','Lanternwood Field Shelter','female',41,'Oni','black hair in a thick braid, amber eyes and rough pale horns','Asa collects buttons, cooks excellent stew and can sit through an entire visitor’s boast without blinking.','Keep the lower route usable without attracting reckless hunters.','She withholds a rumor to keep a paying guest one more night.','Sparse, dry and direct.','Sorts buttons by a system she will not explain.','a hunting spear','A planted guard and short Fire screens defend a retreat.','Akitsuhara')
person('Yukina Tsuribe','root shrine keeper','Lanternwood Root Shrine','female',56,'Oni','white hair in a loose knot, pale blue eyes and gray horns','Yukina tends lamps, loves riddles and cheats outrageously at simple games.','Repair the little shrine’s storm damage.','She frames a personal preference as ancient custom.','Mild, mischievous and precise when challenged.','Moves one game stone when a visitor looks away.','a bell staff','Soul wards protect the tended court, not the whole forest.','Maple Lantern Custodians')

