person('Ema Shiozaki','independent adventurer',"Adventurer's Guild - Benitsuru Branch",'female',29,'Oni','cobalt hair in a messy braid, gray eyes and white horns','Ema hunts contracts, loves maps and is easily impressed by a good meal.','Finance a southern journey with her own earnings.','She underestimates a job after hearing a rival accepted it.','Friendly competitive banter.','Draws a route in spilled tea.','a long spear','A nimble spear guard and controlled Lightning releases.',"Adventurer's Guild")
person('Kaito Honma','shield-bearing adventurer','Saffron Road Hostel','male',26,'Human','black hair, brown eyes and a broad freckled face','Kaito is steady in danger and spectacularly nervous when inviting someone to supper.','Make a reliable adventuring partnership.','He agrees to unfair terms rather than risk rejection.','Plain, courteous and hesitant about personal requests.','Straightens a spoon beside his bowl.','a mace and round shield','Guarded defense, measured shield pressure and patient counters.',"Adventurer's Guild")
person('Misao Shingū','independent rōnin','Three Reeds Inn','female',40,'Oni','short auburn hair, gold eyes and dark swept horns','Misao plays a reed flute beautifully and refuses to admit she likes children’s adventure tales.','Find work that does not ask her to bully debtors.','She starts a fight over an insult she could ignore.','Dry teasing that sharpens quickly.','Checks a flute stop while considering a price.','a nodachi','A long poised guard and forceful single commitments; crowded rooms constrain her.','Akitsuhara')
person('Ren Ishidate','young spear escort','Bamboo Crossing','male',21,'Oni','bright chestnut hair, green eyes and small black horns','Ren is earnest, vain about his boots and delighted by anyone who asks about his training.','Finish a real escort without a senior correcting him.','He interprets caution as a challenge to his courage.','Open, quick and occasionally grandiose.','Buffs a clean boot on the opposite trouser leg.','a plain yari','Basic reach control and disciplined retreat are his best tools.','Akitsuhara')
person('Takane Shibata','traveling archer','Snowcedar Refuge','female',32,'Human','dark brown braid, pale green eyes and a lean weathered face','Takane sketches birds, sleeps late and is unpleasant when someone assumes she will guide for free.','See the lake country after a winter of mountain work.','She lets an annoyance turn into an unnecessarily cruel joke.','Low, wry and unhurried.','Counts arrows while discussing anything else.','a compact bow','Measured Finesse shots from cover and careful footwork.',"Adventurer's Guild")
person('Léonie Vauclair','foreign alchemical buyer','Quarry Exchange','female',87,'High Elf','ash-blond hair, blue eyes, pointed ears and adult proportions','Léonie is an adult elven buyer with immaculate boots and an alarming enthusiasm for ugly minerals. She speaks Elvish and the local common language.','Find a reliable independent supply of amber salts.','She treats a poorer supplier’s caution as ignorance.','Elegant, clipped and suddenly exuberant about a specimen.','Holds a sample beside her cheek in the light.','a metal-tipped cane','Measured Light workings test a material and protect a short withdrawal.','Akitsuhara')
person('Jin Lin','visiting mechanism broker','Koganedai Guesthouse','male',35,'Beastfolk','black hair, brown eyes, dark birdlike feathers at his temples and mostly human features','Jin comes from Yunhai, loves competitive cooking and dresses far more brightly than his business partners.','Sell useful devices without being trapped by a military monopoly.','He gives deliberately incomplete safety warnings to close a sale.','Fast, smiling and exact about delivery.','Spins a brass fitting on the table.','a folding metal staff','Practical staff defense and limited integrated mechanisms; a broken supply line matters.','Akitsuhara')
person('Duncan Rusk','foreign metalworker','Benitsuru Craft Quarter','male',118,'Dwarf','rust-brown hair in a short braid, blue eyes and a broad braided beard','Duncan is an adult dwarf from Dunbrae who likes tall hats, careful steel and ridiculous local sweets.','Set up a repair partnership rather than sell to one patron.','He insults a local technique before understanding its purpose.','A recognizable Scottish accent, plain words and selected Scots expressions.','Braids a loose beard strand while arguing.','a short heavy hammer','A strong guarded stance and disciplined Metal fitting.','Akitsuhara')
person('Akihisa Manabe','academy field researcher','Shiun Pilgrim Lodge','male',25,'Human','brown curls, hazel eyes and round glasses','An adult graduate from Gryffin Tail, Akihisa studies the difference between spoken explanation and learned movement. He loves folk dances and is an awkward dancer.','Write an honest account that his teachers cannot reduce to superstition.','He stages a neat demonstration that omits an inconvenient failure.','Eager analytical questions with embarrassed self-corrections.','Copies a gesture in miniature below the table.','a short wand','Arcane measurements and simple defensive screens.','Akitsuhara')
person('Katsuho Enoki','band quartermaster','Broken Kite Camp','male',39,'Oni','brown shaved sides, dark eyes and rough ocher horns','Katsuho cooks good stew, repairs everyone’s socks and has a very precise system for selling stolen goods.','Leave the road band with enough money for a stall.','He calls handling stolen property a harmless distance from the violence.','Gentle, practical and evasive about provenance.','Mends a sock during a negotiation.','a short axe','Forceful close defense and a planned escape route.','Broken Kite Band',ties='Renga Itsuzaki is his oldest friend; he knows which threats she actually means.')
person('Jun Sasanami','band scout','Broken Kite Camp','male',24,'Human','black hair cut unevenly, green eyes and long thin limbs','Jun is funny, hungry and better at noticing a patrol than handling a confrontation.','Get paid enough to stop sleeping in wet tents.','He steals from frightened travelers to impress his crew.','Quick jokes with an uncertain laugh.','Rolls a stolen button between his fingers.','a short bow','Finesse scouting, one careful shot and rapid retreat.','Broken Kite Band',ties='Renga Itsuzaki calls him a partner but rarely shows him the accounts.')
person('Kohina Beppu','discreet goods broker','Goldleaf Arcade','female',37,'Oni','violet hair in a loose coil, gray eyes and small ivory horns','Kohina loves scented soap, forged antiques and a client who understands discretion.','Buy a quiet inn and retire from favors.','She sells a rumor whose consequences she does not have to witness.','Soft, intimate and effortlessly commercial.','Smells her clean gloves.','','Illusion disguises limited cosmetic details, not ownership or actual quality.','Akitsuhara')
person('Hiroto Sakuma','provincial tax clerk','Mizuhara Castle','male',34,'Human','neat black hair, brown eyes and a narrow careful face','Hiroto enjoys gardening, melodramatic songs and an account that balances.','Get posted close enough to see his partner regularly.','He accepts a favor that compromises a later inspection.','Precise and apologetically persistent.','Aligns the corners of a folded letter.','','An ordinary ward and careful observation.','House Saionoma')
person('Nana Saionoma','household kitchen manager','Saionoma Household','female',45,'Oni','red-brown hair, amber eyes and short cream horns','Nana feeds visitors, dances fiercely and has opinions about every guest’s manners.','Make the kitchen’s ordinary workers visible in the household accounts.','She gives a favorite cousin the easiest shifts.','Fast, affectionate and cutting when tired.','Samples a sauce with a folded leaf.','','Fire cookery and practical treatment of burns.','House Saionoma')

YOKAI = [
 dict(name='Hagire',place='Ragged Cedar Hollow',major=True,level=42,type='Riftlimb Stalker',gender='female',species='Unique forest yokai',
 look='An unnaturally lanky woman-shaped beast nearly three meters tall, with waist-length tangled black hair, washed-out gray eyes and long pale limbs. A faded floral robe hangs loosely from narrow shoulders. A cloth strip partly covers a mouth split far beyond human limits; the torn smile shows pointed uneven teeth. Her elbows, shoulders and knees can unseat and reset through abrupt impossible angles without acquiring extra limbs.',
 public='Forest travelers call her Hagire after the hanging rags left along her trail. She stands almost motionless between trees, then moves in snapping bursts that end at a different height from where they began. Woodcutters abandon a route when they hear the dry crack of her joints.',
 want='Hunt living travelers along the abandoned cedar margins and drag their belongings into high roots.',
 flaw='She becomes fixated on a retreating silhouette and can be drawn into a prepared narrow crossing; sudden speed does not make her aware of every opponent.',
 voice='A distant, breathy imitation of a human question, followed by misplaced laughter and sharp joint sounds.',
 quirk='Hangs strips of cloth at head height before settling into a hunting hollow.',
 method='Hostile to living travelers and their companions by default. She uses reach, false stillness and short violent lunges; dislocating joints changes her angle but does not grant invulnerability or unlimited range. A prepared party can deny her lateral routes, force her beneath a low obstruction or drive her from an occupied path. She does not teleport into towns or safely staffed shrines.'),
 dict(name='Koma',place='Old Bridge Shrine',major=False,level=22,type='Tanuki Wayfarer',gender='male',species='Tanuki yokai',
 look='An adult, broad raccoon-dog yokai with chestnut-brown fur, amber eyes, a dark facial mask and a great fluffy tail. He stands upright in a patched saffron coat, carries an absurdly large folded reed hat and has an expressive animal face rather than human skin.',
 public='Koma insists he is a retired boundary inspector, changes his account when challenged and knows every dry woodland shortcut. He loves dice, traveling songs and payment in a particularly good lunch.',
 want='Secure a small place where people return for his company instead of only directions.',
 flaw='He turns a harmless joke into an expensive nuisance when an audience encourages him.',
 voice='Warm, theatrical bluster, suddenly exact about a promise.',
 quirk='Checks an imaginary official seal beneath his hat.',
 method='Small Illusion disguises and clever use of the wooded trail aid a retreat; he cannot turn leaves into permanent money, erase a debt or command every forest spirit.'),
 dict(name='Suzu-no-Ura',place='Old Bell Shrine',major=False,level=14,type='Awakened Bell',gender='other',species='Awakened bronze bell',
 look='A weathered bronze hand bell the size of a large melon, carried on two knotted cord legs and a tassel tail. Two warm gold lights peer from its dark mouth beneath a chipped rim. Its crown bears a frayed vermilion cord rather than hair, and it has no human torso or horns.',
 public='Suzu-no-Ura wakes guests by ringing at the wrong moment, enjoys being polished and claims every dropped coin is an offering. Its mischief is usually a nuisance, although a startled traveler can still fall.',
 want='Become the bell people actually choose to hear.',
 flaw='It drowns out an uncomfortable answer and refuses to admit anyone else has a better tone.',
 voice='A huffy adult voice punctuated by its own little chimes.',
 quirk='Tilts its entire body to listen, making the clapper betray its position.',
 method='Sound rattles a small object or interrupts concentration. It hides beneath a rail when a threat is serious and has no automatic command over the shrine.'),
 dict(name='Oroha',place='Crane-of-the-Hush Crossing',major=True,level=36,type='Hush Crane',gender='other',species='Unique crane spirit',
 look='An immense white crane spirit with a long black neck stripe, a ragged crimson crown and deep black eyes rimmed pale gold. Layered ivory feathers replace hair; long dark legs stand above the reeds. Its wings carry thin translucent streamers like trailing sleeves, without a human torso or additional arms.',
 public='Oroha waits near the stone crossing in the mist. It can speak, is offended by being fed like a pet and occasionally carries a message after negotiating exactly what will be owed.',
 want='Keep the crossing usable without allowing travelers to treat every spirit as a servant.',
 flaw='It takes discourtesy personally and will allow an inconvenient delay to prove a point.',
 voice='Patient, formal phrases interrupted by sharp observations about a visitor’s manners.',
 quirk='Turns a found object once in its beak before deciding whether to return it.',
 method='Soul workings and strong wings scatter a nearby hostile manifestation. It knows this crossing rather than every route or secret in the Spirit Realm; an agreement earns limited aid, not a permanent companion.')
]

person('Atsuha Yunokawa','onsen proprietor','Hinoki Hollow Onsen','female',46,'Human','copper-brown hair in a low bun, amber-brown eyes and a sturdy adult build','Atsuha keeps a spotless bathhouse, collects dreadful travel excuses and sings old festival songs when she thinks the veranda is empty.','Buy the neglected garden next door and grow her own fragrant bath herbs.','She agrees too quickly with impressive guests, then makes a junior worker explain why the promised exception is impossible.','Warm, brisk and dryly funny; her polite refusal usually comes with a clean towel.','Tests the water with the same chipped cedar dipper she refuses to replace.','a short wooden wand','Small Water workings regulate an ordinary channel; careful inspection and a clear exit matter more than fighting.','Akitsuhara',ties='Aya Takino supplies sturdy bath cloth. Chiyo Matsukaze occasionally sends tired travelers her way.')
